  "description": "<p>There are numerous test failures while building on Windows, most of them seem to be path-related</p>\n\n<p>Failed tests:<br/>\n  ArgParserTest.retrieveConfig:319 expected:&lt;<span class=\"error\">&#91;/tmp/&#93;</span>rdf&gt; but was:&lt;[C:\\tmp]rdf&gt;<br/>\n  ArgParserTest.testSerializedConfigCustom:343 expected:&lt;<span class=\"error\">&#91;/path/to/&#93;</span>export&gt; but was:&lt;[C:\\path\\to]export&gt;<br/>\n  ArgParserTest.testSerializedConfigDefault:365 expected:&lt;<span class=\"error\">&#91;/tmp/&#93;</span>rdf&gt; but was:&lt;[C:\\tmp]rdf&gt;<br/>\nTests in error:<br/>\n  ImporterTest.testDefaultModeRetainsLastModified:267 ▒ IllegalArgument Illegal ...<br/>\n  ImporterTest.testImportContainer:245 ▒ IllegalArgument Illegal character in pa...<br/>\n  ImporterTest.testLegacyModeStripsLastModified:254 ▒ IllegalArgument Illegal ch...<br/>\n  ImporterTest.testSkipPairtree:286 ▒ IllegalArgument Illegal character in path ...<br/>\n  ImporterTest.testUnauthenticatedImportWhenAuthorizationIsRequired ▒  Unexpecte...</p>\n\n<p>For example,<br/>\ntestSkipPairtree(org.fcrepo.importexport.importer.ImporterTest)  Time elapsed: 0.01 sec  &lt;&lt;&lt; ERROR!<br/>\njava.lang.IllegalArgumentException: Illegal character in path at index 28: <a href=\"http://example.org:9999/restab\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">http://example.org:9999/rest\\ab</a></p>",
